---
import { Box } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<>
<section class="w-full flex-center mx-auto px-4 bg-white">
    <div class="w-full col-center gap-6 max-w-6xl my-14 md:my-16 lg:my-20">
        <div class="col-center gap-2">
            <span class="flex-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 bg-[#EAEFF1] border border-[#e4e4e4] rounded-full">
                <Box size={18} stroke-width={2} class="text-gray-800" />
                <h4 class="text-[13px] md:text-[15px] font-medium  text-gray-800">
                    Key Services
                </h4>
            </span>
            <h2 class="h2-bold text-center">
                What Our Development Management Covers
            </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full max-w-4xl flex flex-col items-start justify-center gap-5">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
                <h5 class="h3-base font-semibold">
                    1. Land Feasibility & Acquisition
                </h5>
                <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-500 text-justify px-auto">
                   We help you evaluate land parcels for suitability—accessibility, topography, utilities, and regulatory constraints. We support you through acquisition, title checks, and due diligence. 
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
                <h5 class="h3-base font-semibold">
                    2. Approvals, Permits & Compliance 
                </h5>
                <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-500 text-justify px-auto">
                    From environmental clearances and zoning to local building approvals and fire safety certifications, we navigate the entire regulatory maze on your behalf. 
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
                <h5 class="h3-base font-semibold">
                    3. Design, Engineering & Planning 
                </h5>
                <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-500 text-justify px-auto">
                    We collaborate with architects, structural engineers, and MEP specialists to develop functional, scalable warehouse designs tailored to client requirements.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
                <h5 class="h3-base font-semibold">
                    4. Project Finance & Budgeting 
                </h5>
                <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-500 text-justify px-auto">
                    We structure funding plans, cost forecasting, and cash flow models to keep your project financially viable and on track. 
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
                <h5 class="h3-base font-semibold">
                    5. Procurement & Vendor Management  
                </h5>
                <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-500 text-justify px-auto">
                    We source quality materials, manage vendors, issue contracts, and supervise deliveries—guaranteeing cost-effectiveness and consistency. 
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
                <h5 class="h3-base font-semibold">
                    6. Construction, Site Monitoring & Quality Assurance
                </h5>
                <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-500 text-justify px-auto">
                    Our on-ground project managers ensure execution aligns with design, safety norms, material standards, and timelines. 
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
                <h5 class="h3-base font-semibold">
                    7. Marketing, Leasing & Sales Strategy  
                </h5>
                <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-500 text-justify px-auto">
                    We craft go-to-market plans, targeting strategic tenants and investors. We handle branding, pitch materials, and tenant acquisition. 
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
                <h5 class="h3-base font-semibold">
                    8. Handover & Operational Transition 
                </h5>
                <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-500 text-justify px-auto">
                    Once construction is complete, we facilitate final inspections, certifications, and a smooth transition to operations or asset management. 
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
</>